OraEditor
========

This directory contains the official ready-to-use OraEditor 0.1.4 browser
bundle (JS + CSS + manifest) from:

    https://github.com/tallyhome/OraEditor
    ready/ora-editor/

OraEditor is an autonomous TypeScript rich-text engine. The Core is independent
of Laravel and of any UI framework. The Laravel adapter package `ora/laravel`
is not published on Packagist; OraNotes therefore vendors this official kit
instead of copying the TypeScript source.

License: MIT (see packages/laravel/composer.json in the OraEditor repository).
Copyright remains with the OraEditor authors (tallyhome).

Do not edit ora-editor.js / ora-editor.css by hand. Replace the files from a
newer official ready/ release when upgrading. Checksums: ora-editor.manifest.json.
